  },
  {
    "id": 2019015020110,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "さなぴー、前に言ってくれたよね\r\n『これからのうちを見て、確かめる』って",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201901502/2019015020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019015020120,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "それ、きっと今だって思うんだ\r\nだから──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201901502/2019015020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "愛依の友人",
    "text": "──ちょっと考えさせてもらっていい？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "se": "0328"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019015020130,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……！\r\nごめん！　うち、一方的にしゃべっちゃったわ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0327",
    "voice": "produce_events/201901502/2019015020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "愛依の友人",
    "text": "ううん、そうじゃないの",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0237",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 900
  },
  {
    "speaker": "愛依の友人",
    "text": "……自信がないんだよね、私",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019015020140,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……どういう、こと？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201901502/2019015020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "愛依の友人",
    "text": "ずっと見てきたから、さすがにもうわかるよ\r\nアイドルの愛依が、無理にやってるものじゃないってこと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "愛依の友人",
    "text": "でも、それを理解しちゃったから、怖い",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "愛依の友人",
    "text": "ここまで本気の愛依を見てもまだ『可愛い愛依を見たい』\r\nって思っちゃうかもしれない自分が",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019015020150,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "……さなぴー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201901502/2019015020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "愛依の友人",
    "text": "愛依が大事にしてるものを心から認められなかったら\r\n私、友達失格じゃない？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2019015020160,
    "speaker": "愛依",
    "text": "そんなことない！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "mei",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201901502/2019015020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "愛依の友人",
